The PR description states that the Composer autoloader should take precedence, but the current order of registration ensures the custom autoloader is checked first. In PHP, `spl_autoload_register` appends to the stack by default. Since `register_autoloader()` is called before `load_dependencies()`, the custom autoloader will be at the top of the stack. Swap these calls to ensure Composer acts as the primary loader.

```php
        $this->load_dependencies();
        $this->register_autoloader();
```

